theme_override_font_sizes/font_size = 24
text = "Survival of the fittest. The forst is home to nature and something beyond that. Use your survival skills to satisfy your hunger and dont forget about warmth. Do what you have to. Build, explore, chop down trees, hunt. But be careful... for there is a creature, a being, a monster, a god. It show up to hunt you down or.. pretend to be one of the creatures around you. Do not trust what you hunt. For it will catch you if you attack it. It is unkillable. Unless you find the secret wepon (a gun, duh.). So be careful out there..and hunt down the beast of this forest."
autowrap_mode = 2

